# The network-filter app is a signed, notarized macOS bundle. Git's own heuristic calls five of its
# files text — including `_CodeSignature/CodeResources`, which the signature seals byte for byte — so a
# clone with `core.autocrlf=true` would rewrite line endings and break the signature. The failure
# surfaces as the freshness guard saying the app is not the recorded one, which is true and misleading.
packages/ios-agent/bin/TapflowNetFilter.app/** binary
